matrix is upper triangular with diagonal 16 before normalization. Thus the
first 190 columns have rank at most `190-28=162` over `Q(gamma)`.

At every computed good reduction this component has rank 162. Specialization
therefore supplies the opposite lower bound, so

```text
rank_Q(gamma)(Q_component0) = 162.
```

